@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/Privacy.css">
<div class="header-container">
    <h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
    <div class="desktopContent">
        <img src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uber-static/emails/2017/01/EM1_HI1_338x240@2x.png" width="338" height="" alt="">
    </div>
    <p>Our privacy policy outlines how we handle your personal information when you use our car rental services in Ethiopia.</p>

</div>

<div class="wrapper">
    <details>
        <summary class="summary">
            Overview
        </summary>
        <p class="content">
            At Ethiopian Car Rentals, we are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring the security of your personal information. This privacy policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your data when you interact with our website and utilize our car rental services.
        </p>
    </details>
    <details>
        <summary class="summary">
            Collection of Information
        </summary>
        <p class="content">
            We collect various types of information from you when you visit our website or use our services, including your name, contact details, payment information, and vehicle preferences. This information is necessary for us to provide you with efficient and personalized car rental solutions.
        </p>
    </details>
    <details>
        <summary class="summary">
            Use of Information
        </summary>
        <p class="content">
            The information we collect is used for purposes such as processing your rental bookings, improving our website and services, communicating with you about your reservations, and ensuring compliance with legal and regulatory requirements. We may also use your data for marketing and promotional activities with your consent.
        </p>
    </details>
    <details>
        <summary class="summary">
            Data Security
        </summary>
        <p class="content">
            We take data security seriously and have implemented robust measures to protect your information from unauthorized access, misuse, or alteration. Our website and systems are secured using industry-standard encryption technologies, and access to your data is restricted to authorized personnel only.
        </p>
    </details>
    <details>
        <summary class="summary">
            Information Sharing
        </summary>
        <p class="content">
            We may share your personal information with trusted third-party service providers who assist us in delivering our car rental services, such as vehicle suppliers, payment processors, and marketing agencies. However, we do not sell or disclose your data to unaffiliated third parties for their own marketing purposes without your explicit consent.
        </p>
    </details>
    <details>
        <summary class="summary">
            Your Rights
        </summary>
        <p class="content">
            You have the right to access, update, or delete the personal information we hold about you. You can also opt out of receiving marketing communications from us at any time by updating your preferences in your account settings or contacting our customer support team. Please note that certain data may be retained for legal or administrative purposes even after deletion.
        </p>
    </details>
    <details>
        <summary class="summary">
            Contact Us
        </summary>
        <p class="content">
            If you have any questions or concerns about our privacy policy or the handling of your personal information, please contact us at privacy@ethiopiancarrentals.com. Our dedicated privacy team will be happy to assist you and address any issues promptly.
        </p>
    </details>
    <details>
        <summary class="summary">
            Additional Information
        </summary>
        <p class="content">
            For additional details about how we collect, use, and protect your data, please refer to our full Privacy Policy document. By using our website and services, you agree to the terms outlined in this policy and consent to the processing of your personal information as described herein.
        </p>
    </details>
</div>


<script>
    var div = document.querySelector('div');
    var textNode = document.createTextNode('');
    linebreak = document.createElement("br");

    div.appendChild(linebreak);
    div.appendChild(textNode);</script>